cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and the SuperMimic paper when using this implementation."
title: "SuperMimic-Q1: Independent Whole-Body Motion Tracking for Q1 V2"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: "SuperMimic-Q1 contributors"
abstract: >-
  Independent research implementation of differentiable world-model and
  short-horizon actor-critic motion tracking for Q1 V2. Paper-level tracking
  quality and real-robot deployment are not yet demonstrated.
keywords:
  - humanoid robotics
  - motion tracking
  - world models
  - Q1 V2
